@startuml Sum_Ssfm_Secp_Errors_Aggregator_Handler
top to bottom direction
skinparam linetype ortho

legend top left
    "Sum_Ssfm_Secp_Errors_Aggregator"

**Interfaces Legend**
   //II152 //: ERRH_ExecutionStatus
   //ri120 //: BswM_SECPErrors
