note top of EC
It is responsible for verifying the occurrence of SECP errors. It verifies if any SECP error occurred and if a general, memory or sequence error occurred.
end note

component [SSFM::Sum_Ssfm_Secp_Errors_Aggregator_Handler] as EC{
    portin ri120

	[Sum_Ssfm_Secp_Errors_Aggregator_Handler]  as E
}
   interface II152
   interface II164
   interface II165


  II152 -> E
  ri120 -> E
  E -> II164
  E -> II165  


@enduml
